OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser for families
OL,4,A'devastated' by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community has rallied together to
OL,7,Fsupport families affected by the recent
OL,8,Ffires that devastated homes.
OL,10,FIn Warstock, Birmingham, six families
OL,11,Flost their homes and five more were
OL,12,Fleft with severe smoke damage when the
OL,13,Fblaze tore through Gorleston Road on 13
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FA fundraiser and family fun day is set
OL,17,Fto place on Saturday at Warstock
OL,18,FCommunity Centre, to support the
OL,19,Ffamilies whose homes and belongings
OL,20,Fwere destroyed.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
