OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser for families
OL,4,A'devastated' by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire took place on the hottest day
OL,7,Fof the year as temperatures peaked at
OL,8,F38.1C in some parts of the country, and
OL,9,Falso a day when several more fires were
OL,10,Freported in the West Midlands including
OL,11,Fin Stourbridge, Pershore and
OL,12,FWillenhall.
